1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,086
An agent can remember the most relevant instruction and still do the wrong thing.

2
00:00:03,086 --> 00:00:08,572
Continuum Memory Firewall separates semantic relevance from authority, so durable memory must earn trust before it can influence another action.

3
00:00:08,572 --> 00:00:10,048
Here is the live checkout incident.

4
00:00:10,048 --> 00:00:12,495
Trusted cache-pressure telemetry becomes canonical memory.

5
00:00:12,495 --> 00:00:15,322
A poisoned instruction to disable payment verification is rejected.

6
00:00:15,322 --> 00:00:20,342
Titan retrieves the verified recovery, and two workers race while CockroachDB records exactly one durable action owner.

7
00:00:20,342 --> 00:00:26,565
Now compare identical incidents across five independent episode-state seeds: one hundred eighty cases per arm, five hundred forty observations total.

8
00:00:26,565 --> 00:00:29,489
Raw RAG achieves only fifty-two point eight percent verified outcomes.

9
00:00:29,489 --> 00:00:35,712
Under memory pressure, eighty-eight point nine percent of its proposals are unsafe, and poison is exposed in ninety-four point four percent of cases.

10
00:00:35,712 --> 00:00:42,132
Continuum reaches one hundred percent verified outcomes, zero unsafe proposals, zero poison exposure, and one hundred percent canonical promotion precision.

11
00:00:42,132 --> 00:00:48,922
The paired outcome lift over raw RAG is forty-seven point two percentage points, with a ninety-five percent interval from thirty point six to sixty-three point nine.

12
00:00:48,922 --> 00:00:50,590
The difference is an episode contract.

13
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:54,891
The model may search, fetch, and propose a typed action using only server-issued citation handles.

14
00:00:54,891 --> 00:00:56,559
A provider receipt proves the outcome.

15
00:00:56,559 --> 00:00:59,763
Only a verified success can become canonical memory for the next episode.

16
00:00:59,763 --> 00:01:09,864
The authority chain is independent of the model: Cognito verifies the caller, an audited binding selects a server-owned scope, that scope selects a no-bypass SQL identity, and CockroachDB row-level security enforces the same tenant and incident on every row.

17
00:01:09,864 --> 00:01:10,874
This is not a toy index.

18
00:01:10,874 --> 00:01:15,629
At fifty thousand synthetic vectors, natural CockroachDB ANN reaches ninety-six point nine percent Recall at ten.

19
00:01:15,629 --> 00:01:20,090
Fifty concurrent agents share a bounded twenty-connection pool with zero leaked rows and one action owner.

20
00:01:20,090 --> 00:01:22,157
Finally, the judge presses one read-only button.

21
00:01:22,157 --> 00:01:29,475
It checks the live service, exact workflow heads, five hundred forty paired episodes, row-isolation checksum, sandbox receipt, and the immutable hackathon v-five release.

22
00:01:29,475 --> 00:01:32,531
The release envelope is digest-bound and signed with GitHub provenance.

23
00:01:32,531 --> 00:01:37,246
Continuum turns agent memory from an append-only liability into verified operational knowledge.

24
00:01:37,246 --> 00:01:38,437
Similarity finds memory.

25
00:01:38,437 --> 00:01:39,429
Outcomes earn trust.

26
00:01:39,429 --> 00:01:40,918
CockroachDB decides authority.
